WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 f8c737461bf364654b8a618e515caeb8

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.210
Karibu tena. Sawa, sasa tutachukua

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.400
mchepuko kidogo, tutapita njia ya pembeni

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.480
sasa, na kuangalia kitu utakachohitaji

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.850
kujua kama utawahi kufanya kitu cha kuonekana

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.860
kwa macho kwa kutumia msimbo. Na hata kama unataka kuwa

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.460
mtaalamu wa data na unafikiri mambo yote

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:16.180
ya kuchora ni ya kuchosha kidogo, kuwasilisha data

00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:19.180
kwa njia zinazoonekana ni ujuzi muhimu, kwa hiyo

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.790
ni vizuri sana kujifunza. Katika video hii,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.220
tutaangalia njia mbili tofauti za

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:28.670
kueleza rangi. Sasa, tayari umekuwa ukitumia rangi

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:31.640
kwa majina yao kama nyekundu au njano

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.800
kama ingizo la mwisho katika vitendakazi vyako vya kuchora,

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.300
na hiyo imekuwa njia nzuri ya

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.320
kutumia rangi haraka, lakini ina mipaka sana.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.350
Kuna rangi chache tu zenye majina

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:44.370
ambazo tunaweza kutumia. Kwa hiyo sasa tutaangalia

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.880
njia mbili za kueleza rangi yoyote

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.960
unayotaka, na hizo mbili zinaitwa RGB na

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:54.920
HSL. Kwa hiyo RGB inatuwezesha kufikiri juu ya rangi

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.100
kama mchanganyiko wa nyekundu, kijani na bluu.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.210
Ndiyo maana ya RGB: nyekundu (red), kijani (green), bluu (blue).

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.040
Kama unakumbuka kuchanganya rangi za kupaka shuleni,

00:01:04.099 --> 00:01:06.730
ni wazo kama hilo, isipokuwa badala ya rangi ya kupaka,

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:11.580
tunachanganya mwanga. Katika mazoezi mengi yanayofuata,

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:14.440
utakuwa na kitendakazi kinachoitwa RGB,

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.960
na kitachukua namba tatu

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.040
kama ingizo, moja kwa nyekundu, moja kwa kijani,

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.240
moja kwa bluu, na kitarejesha

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:26.900
rangi. Namba unazoweza kutumia

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:32.940
kama ingizo zinaanzia sifuri hadi 255. Sifuri inamaanisha

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.440
sitaki rangi hiyo kabisa, na

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:38.420
255 inamaanisha changanya rangi hiyo

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:41.460
kwa kiwango cha juu iwezekanavyo. Kwa hiyo tukitumia

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:45.550
kitendakazi RGB tukiweka 255, sifuri na sifuri

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:48.190
kama ingizo, tunasema nataka

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.440
nyekundu yote. Kumbuka kwamba 255 ni

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:52.880
namba kubwa zaidi unayoweza kuweka hapo.

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.800
Lakini hatutaki kijani wala

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:57.420
bluu yoyote, kwa hiyo zote mbili ni sifuri. Kwa hiyo

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:00.880
tunapata nyekundu, na tunaweza kuhifadhi

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.360
nyekundu hiyo kwenye variable na kisha kuitumia

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.340
katika kitendakazi cha circle kama tulivyokuwa

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.840
tukifanya na string zenye majina. Sasa

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.759
vipi kama tutatumia kitendakazi RGB tukiweka

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:15.340
sifuri, 255, sifuri? Sasa tunasema hakuna nyekundu,

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.310
kijani kote, hakuna bluu. Kwa hiyo tunapata

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.440
duara la kijani. Vipi kama tunataka

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:25.320
njano? Njano ni mchanganyiko wa nyekundu

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.940
na kijani. Kwa hiyo tunaweza kusema nipe

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.840
nyekundu yote, kijani kote,

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.120
na hakuna bluu, na hiyo itatupa

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.200
njano. Na tunaweza kutumia namba

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:37.730
ndogo ndogo. Kwa hiyo tukitaka nyekundu kidogo,

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.150
hakuna kijani, na bluu nyingi, tunapata

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:45.080
zambarau. Na nyekundu nyingi, kijani kidogo,

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:47.000
bluu kidogo zaidi, hiyo inatupa

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:51.360
pinki. Kwa hiyo hiyo ndiyo RGB. Tunachanganya nyekundu, kijani

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:56.060
na bluu kupata michanganyiko tofauti. Sasa hebu

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.960
tuangalie HSL, inayotupa njia

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:03.060
tofauti kabisa ya kufikiri juu ya rangi. HSL ni kifupi

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:08.200
cha mwelekeo wa rangi (hue), ukolevu (saturation) na mwanga (lightness).

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:11.900
Na kama ilivyo kwa RGB, unakuwa na kitendakazi kinachoitwa HSL

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.590
kinachochukua namba tatu, moja kwa mwelekeo wa rangi,

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.100
moja kwa ukolevu, na moja kwa mwanga, na

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.420
kitarejesha rangi. Kwa hiyo hebu tuchambue

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:25.160
maana ya maneno hayo matatu. Mwelekeo wa rangi

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:28.080
ni aina ya rangi unayotaka, na

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:32.300
unaanzia sifuri hadi 360. Labda

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.200
fikiria upinde wa mvua. Hivi ndivyo mimi hufikiri

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.200
kuhusu hilo. Upande wa kushoto tuna nyekundu,

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:39.220
kisha tuna machungwa, njano, kijani, bluu,

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.320
zambarau, na kwa kweli tunarudi

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:44.760
hadi kwenye nyekundu. Kwa hiyo ukisema sifuri,

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:47.100
unaanzia kushoto, na hiyo ni

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:50.700
nyekundu. Ukisema 120, unaomba

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:54.580
kijani. 230 ni bluu. Unaweza pia kufikiria

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.470
hii kama gurudumu la rangi, ambalo

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.500
ndilo 360 hasa. Ni idadi

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.440
ya digrii katika duara. Sasa, mimi huwa

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.360
natafuta tu namba ninazotaka, kwa hiyo

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:07.000
usijali sana kujaribu kukariri

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:09.340
hivi, lakini ni vizuri kujua

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.720
kinachoendelea. Kwa hiyo huo ni mwelekeo wa rangi,

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:16.019
ambao ni aina ya rangi. Kisha tuna ukolevu, ambao ni

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.920
jinsi rangi ilivyojaa na yenye nguvu. Unaanzia sifuri

00:04:19.019 --> 00:04:22.060
hadi 100. Kwenye sifuri, unapata kijivu tu.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.440
Hakuna rangi, hakuna toni

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.160
ndani yake kabisa. Kwenye 100, unapata rangi kamili,

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:32.660
iliyojaa na yenye nguvu. Na kisha tuna mwanga. Mwanga

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.860
ni jinsi rangi inavyong'aa, na hiyo

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.600
nayo inaanzia sifuri hadi 100. Kwenye

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:40.200
sifuri, unapata nyeusi. Haijalishi umechagua

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:43.460
mwelekeo gani wa rangi, unapata nyeusi. Hakuna mwanga

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.500
ndani yake. Na kwenye 100, unapata nyeupe.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:49.000
Haijalishi kitu kingine chochote, imejaa

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:52.420
mwanga tu, kwa hiyo ni nyeupe. 50 iko

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:55.490
katikati kabisa, rangi ya kawaida. Kwa hiyo unaweza

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.550
kufikiria hii kama kiteleza cha kufanya

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:01.260
rangi iwe angavu zaidi au nyeusi zaidi. Kwa hiyo

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.840
tukitaka duara la kawaida la nyekundu, ambalo tungekuwa

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:07.680
tumeandika kama 255, sifuri, sifuri kwa RGB,

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.640
nyekundu yote, hakuna kijani, hakuna bluu, hapa

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:15.560
tungetumia sifuri, 100, 50. Sifuri kwa

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:19.290
mwelekeo wa rangi nyekundu, 100 kwa ukolevu, rangi kamili,

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:22.060
na 50 kwa mwanga, ambao ni kiwango

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.240
cha kawaida cha mwanga. Tukitaka kulifanya hilo

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.800
duara la kijani, tunaweza kubadilisha tu

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.700
mwelekeo huo wa rangi uwe 120. Tukitaka

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.260
kulifanya kijani cha giza zaidi, tunaweza kupunguza

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:37.340
mwanga hadi 25. Tukitaka

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.360
kulifanya kijani hafifu zaidi, tunaweza

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.780
kuondoa sehemu ya rangi, sehemu ya

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.860
ukolevu, tuseme tuipunguze hadi 30.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.800
Kama unataka pinki angavu na kali,

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:52.080
mwelekeo wa rangi wa karibu 300 ni pinki, kisha

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.680
tunapandisha ukolevu hadi 100

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.560
kuifanya iwe na nguvu kweli kweli, na tunapandisha

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:01.290
pia mwanga hadi karibu 60. Kwa hiyo tuna

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.660
njia mbili tofauti za kueleza rangi, na

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:07.830
zinafaa katika hali tofauti. RGB ni nzuri

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:12.160
unapotaka kurekebisha sehemu moja maalum,

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.380
ni kiasi gani cha nyekundu, kiasi gani cha kijani,

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:17.540
kiasi gani cha bluu. HSL ni nzuri unapotaka

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.060
kupitia rangi mbalimbali kwa mzunguko. Kama unataka upinde wa mvua,

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.440
unaweza kuendelea kuongeza mwelekeo wa rangi tu.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.360
Katika mazoezi machache yanayofuata, utatumia

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.500
njia hizi zote mbili pamoja na vitanzi

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:31.020
na kubadilisha baadhi ya variable ili kuunda upinde wa mvua na

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.280
machweo ya jua. Nitakukumbusha

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:36.400
maelezo yote katika maelekezo ya zoezi, kwa hiyo usijali

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:40.140
kama bado hujakariri haya yote.

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:41.640
Kila la heri, furahia, na tutaonana

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:42.060
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
